  "details": "The directional lighting that is on toon standard when using a normal map texture doesn't work like it should on quest. Yet without a normal map it works- Could it be possible to get that fixed for quest, that has so much potential to be great!\n\nON PC: It works just fine, the shading moves almost perfectly as according to the normal map, virtually no issues here.\n\nON QUEST: Whenever uploaded it seems fine, but when I test it out via quest, I notice the shading freezes, only utilizing Toon 2 Band shading, while the shadows from the normal map stay still instead of moving with the directional lighting like its supposed to. (I'd send an example video but it is over 8 mb-)",
